{
    "title": "Building Hidden Shelters",
    "description": "Learn to create hidden directories and move people to safety",
    "commands_taught": ["mkdir", "echo", "ls -a", "mv", "cd"],
    "steps": [
        {
            "step": 1,
            "story": [
                "Wow! You built a toolshed. You now have the power of mkdir.",
                "",
                "Ruth: \"That's amazing! Please help me build a shelter!",
                "Can we build it in the barn, as then it'll be easier to move the animals inside.\"",
                "",
                "Go back into the barn."
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/toolshed",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "commands": ["cd ..", "cd ../barn"],
            "hints": [
                "Use 'cd ..' to go back to the farm.",
                "Then use 'cd barn' to go into the barn."
            ],
            "next": [38, 2]
        },
        {
            "step": 2,
            "story": [
                "Ruth: \"Your toolshed was great, but anyone would be able to find it.\"",
                "\"Is it possible to make something hidden?\"",
                "",
                "1: \"If we call it 'hidden-shelter', that will make it hidden.\"",
                "2: \"Putting a . at the front makes things hidden.\"",
                "3: \"It's impossible to make a hidden shelter.\"",
                "",
                "Use 'echo' to tell Ruth how to make things hidden."
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "commands": ["echo 1", "echo 2", "echo 3"],
            "hints": [
                "Ruth: \"You're really going to have to speak up, I can't understand anything you're saying.\"",
                "Use 'echo 1', 'echo 2' or 'echo 3' to reply to Ruth."
            ],
            "next": [38, 3]
        },
        {
            "step": 3,
            "story": [
                "Ruth: \"So if we called the shelter '.shelter', it would be hidden? Let's try it!\"",
                "",
                "Build a shelter called '.shelter'"
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "commands": ["mkdir .shelter"],
            "hints": [
                "Make '.shelter' using 'mkdir .shelter' - remember the dot!"
            ],
            "next": [38, 4]
        },
        {
            "step": 4,
            "story": [
                "Check it is properly hidden. Use 'ls' to see if it is visible."
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "commands": ["ls"],
            "hints": [
                "Use 'ls', not 'ls -a', to check your shelter is hidden."
            ],
            "next": [38, 5]
        },
        {
            "step": 5,
            "story": [
                "Good, we can't see it in the barn.",
                "",
                "Now look around with 'ls -a' to check it actually exists!"
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "commands": ["ls -a"],
            "hints": [
                "Use 'ls -a' to look around."
            ],
            "next": [38, 6]
        },
        {
            "step": 6,
            "story": [
                "It worked! You've successfully created something hidden.",
                "",
                "Ruth: \"Did you make something? That's amazing!\"",
                "\"...unfortunately I can't see it...please can you put me and the animals inside?\"",
                "",
                "Move everyone into the '.shelter' one by one."
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "commands": ["mv Trotter .shelter/", "mv Daisy .shelter/", "mv Cobweb .shelter/", "mv Ruth .shelter/"],
            "hints": [
                "Use 'mv Trotter .shelter/' to move Trotter into the shelter.",
                "Move all the animals and Ruth into the .shelter."
            ],
            "modifications": [
                {
                    "action": "remove",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/Trotter"
                },
                {
                    "action": "remove",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/Daisy"
                },
                {
                    "action": "remove",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/Cobweb"
                },
                {
                    "action": "remove",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/Ruth"
                },
                {
                    "action": "add",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/.shelter/Trotter",
                    "type": "file",
                    "content": "Trotter"
                },
                {
                    "action": "add",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/.shelter/Daisy",
                    "type": "file",
                    "content": "Daisy"
                },
                {
                    "action": "add",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/.shelter/Cobweb",
                    "type": "file",
                    "content": "Cobweb"
                },
                {
                    "action": "add",
                    "path": "~/farm/barn/.shelter/Ruth",
                    "type": "file",
                    "content": "Ruth"
                }
            ],
            "next": [38, 7]
        },
        {
            "step": 7,
            "story": [
                "Go into the '.shelter' along with Ruth and the animals."
            ],
            "start_dir": "~/farm/barn",
            "end_dir": "~/farm/barn/.shelter",
            "commands": ["cd .shelter"],
            "hints": [
                "Type 'cd .shelter' to go into the .shelter."
            ],
            "next": [39, 1]
        }
    ]
}